    <node id="P031-C0026"><data key="label">Not an order-closure: The map E_ tau,f is an affine endomap of Delta(Z) (indeed a Markov kernel on Z ), and it is always idempotent as an endomap only in special regimes. We treat E_ tau,f within the ``fixed points of (approx) idempotents&#x27;&#x27; framework (S ), no…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
