    <node id="P026-C0010"><data key="label">Model-Realization Results: The paper records four scoped model-realization theorems plus secondary high-structure recovery results: PICA model-realization (Model Theorem 33, Subsection 13.2): PICAReal_ fin ^ aud _ fin-stoch ^ cell/pair/prov :model_realization…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
