    <node id="P028-C0029"><data key="label">No Unstatused Residual: Let R be a residual type, let P be a formed stability package over R , and let st_ P :R S be the declared typed-status classifier supplied by the package. Assume the package discipline makes st_ P single-valued on native residual recor…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
