    <node id="P028-C0100"><data key="label">Foundations IV\ does not claim that the 52-row catalog is complete under future developments.</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
    <node id="P028-C0101"><data key="label">Nonclaims and caveats: This chapter is the consolidated nonclaims landing for Foundations IV. The per-axis chapters state the local caveats where they matter; here the scope fence and the prepared objection mitigations are collected in one place. [label=N .,…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
