    <node id="P030-C0001"><data key="label">The structural laws of the Six Birds corpus through Foundations IV are stated from the standpoint of an external theorist: the theorist declares a lens, detects an obstruction, installs a repair, prices a residual, and runs the audit. This paper makes the clo…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
    <node id="P030-C0002"><data key="label">Theory package and formed object: A theory package is T=(Z,f,Sigma_f,E, A), where Z is a finite carrier, f a declared lens, Sigma_f its definability structure, E a packaging or completion endomap, and A an audit. A formed object is a declared fixed point of t…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
