    <node id="P030-C0004"><data key="label">Six-part normal form: Each E-law is presented in the following order: Setup; Theorem; Proof spine; Case enumeration; Interaction status; Nonclaims. The layer-instantiation paragraph that follows is not a seventh proof field. It identifies candidate realizatio…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
    <node id="P030-C0005"><data key="label">Repair join: Order quotients by refinement: Q_1 Q_0 when Q_1 is finer than Q_0 . For quotients Q,R on a common carrier, the repair join Q R is the coarsest quotient refining both. Source repair by R is the move Q↦ Q R .</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
    <node id="P030-C0006"><data key="label">Predictive surplus: For current quotient Q , declared predictive baseline M , and horizon tau , first require the certified order comparison CD_tau(M) CD_tau(Q). For rational scores define S_tau(QVert M):=CD_tau(Q)-CD_tau(M), which is nonnegative exactly unde…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
