    <node id="P034-C0006"><data key="label">Definition (closure package). A closure package is a pair pkg=(X,op) where op: X→ X is idempotent: op(op(x))=op(x) for all x∈ X. The package is the theorem-track realization of the fixed P5 object. When the package is held fixed, repeated application of op re…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
