    <node id="P034-C0045"><data key="label">Boundary of the theorem: Theorem is the theorem-bearing summit of the paper. It is conditional, not unconditional. It does not claim a global canonical-collapse theorem, and it does not assert that every possible ledger or support regime selects the same repr…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
