    <node id="P034-C0052"><data key="label">Internal theorem inventory: This appendix serves as an inventory and Lean map for the in-house theorem package used in the body. It does not restate the theorem sections. Its purpose is documentary: to show which theorem surfaces belong to the internal ladder…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
