    <node id="P040-C0215"><data key="label">Why the promotion is not merely notation: The cohomology interface separates local data by global obstruction class. A purely local edge-admissibility interface collapses those distinctions. Therefore the cohomology layer is not a relabeling of the local laye…</data><data key="ntype">CLAIM</data></node>
